        "name": "USN-8130-2",
        "description": "USN-8130-1 fixed a vulnerability in GStreamer Base Plugins. This update provides the corresponding update for Ubuntu 18.04 LTS and Ubuntu 20.04 LTS.  Original advisory details:   It was discovered that GStreamer Base Plugins incorrectly handled certain  AVI media files. A remote attacker could use this issue to cause GStreamer  Base Plugins to crash, resulting in a denial of service, or possibly  execute arbitrary code.",
